Subject: [PATCH] Sea ice against GLORYS: area, extent, volume, thickness and
 ice speed by region
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

analysis/sea_ice_comparison.jl reads the daily sea-ice averages (h, ℵ, uᵢ,
vᵢ) and GLORYS's daily sea ice every n days (regridded onto the model grid),
and compares them by region: area, extent, volume, mean thickness, and the
mean and 95th-percentile ice speed where the concentration exceeds 15 %.
Tables in output_dir/sea_ice_comparison.md; time series and maps (mean ice
speed, model and GLORYS; concentration difference) in figure_dir.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
